(rectangle (start 109.22 35.56) (end 190.5 71.12) (stroke (width 0) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "d33b4611-33e9-5048-9b14-2787fa1c6e1a"))
(text "Touch address strap footprint (G9)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 110.49 34.29 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b1141783-c00f-503b-899a-838d268ab881"))
(text_box "Notes\n1. Function: the faceplate control bus and its interrupts (record 24): I2C3 at 400 kHz with\n   2.2 kΩ (≤ 100 pF from the faceplate), HID_INT (wake) and ALS_INT 4.7 kΩ, all on FP_3V3.\n2. Absent state: FP_3V3 off: the pull-ups are unpowered, no faceplate part is back-powered;\n   the interrupts read low and are masked by software.\n3. SPI CS 10 kΩ pull-up (inactive at faceplate power-up, pinout v1): value a capture choice.\n4. GT911 address strap: a DNP pull-down footprint on FP_TP_INT (Alternate gt911-strap); the SoC\n   pull-down sets the default address." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 140.97 0) (size 129.54 20.32) (margins 1.905 1.905 1.905 1.905) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "14b12507-9a57-5e34-a0e5-e9bc7168dd7b"))
